  "source_name": "https://www.whattoexpect.com/birth-chart-calculator/",
  "source_type": "website",
  "structure": {
    "block_count": 43,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Birth Chart Calculator",
        "text_sha256": "99d6efdc891cf60b56b6b8a838e2ab6fe6961e96972dac3242a7aa21d644b58e",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What were the stars whispering the moment your baby arrived earthside? Just enter her birth details for a peek into your sweet pea’s planetary story.",
        "text_sha256": "9fa25a6355917eca0ba5fdf0243f5c1dbbc2979c740c5cb5d7607ddbc0e0bb8b",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Curious what the stars were whispering the moment your sweet pea arrived earthside? Our free birth chart tool lets you peek into the planetary story written just for your little love. Just pop in her birth details and we’ll reveal her cosmic baby book written in the sky. It’s stargazing, tailored to your tiny dreamer.",
        "text_sha256": "e486bd3cd96813e129066152bfceea4efe63c305db3f07e97d27b26b3bd95476",
        "word_count": 55
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Your baby’s birth chart, decoded",
        "text_sha256": "045cb0f13d2338903cb1b4f345e71c2d7279a613f00ffbeb3a7b775045a7bccb",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Think of it like a cosmic baby book: a one-of-a-kind map of where the Sun, Moon, and planets were when your little one took her first breath. Each detail — from her rising sign to where Venus was hanging out — offers sweet insight into your baby’s personality, emotions, and growing style.",
        "text_sha256": "b9cd6618cb217dc271e41ba540a160ffba917d15ae40b5db89caab96d7e0472f",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What you’ll see",
        "text_sha256": "63d030ae0373c0e59d37022d5d844b5b0a5420ef245365be015dd5d95091446e",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Your child’s chart will look like a big starry wheel, divided into 12 “houses” (kind of like celestial rooms). Each house hosts a zodiac sign — maybe Leo in the first, Pisces in the twelfth — and the planets take their places throughout, forming a beautiful sky story.",
        "text_sha256": "77823cbd0d45388a6fcc40cc7fa1b75241f973568039e3ff94ae3dafdbe0dd31",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For example: If the Moon was shining through the sign of Taurus in the second house at the time of birth, that gives your little one a Taurus Moon in the 2nd house, which could hint at a love for cozy routines, sweet treats, and lots of snuggles.",
        "text_sha256": "5b00ac7e62c732b06e95f0bca9866214927761f4fdd088fbc7d1838e8884926d",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Astrologers look at all these pieces — signs, houses, planets, and their little cosmic conversations (called “aspects”) — to paint a fuller picture of your baby’s emotional rhythm, natural gifts, and soulful sparkle.",
        "text_sha256": "b1cfe81a3471566f2addac6f392d5b44fc42973dd7ade00df2b31216b5695fa3",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "A few helpful notes before you begin",
        "text_sha256": "4a4368365e50f80c20f669782b66195a8b018e2b4d82bea7749611eb92338419",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You don’t need to share your child’s full name unless you want to. Providing a nickname or initial (or even leaving it blank) is just fine. The chart is all about your baby's birth details.",
        "text_sha256": "864289d347ea2ba8edd3a7efba1df184fb5e4c3e99df86bd43913f83ec3cc301",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For the location field, just pop in the city where your little one was born. (Typing “Boston” should give you dropdown options — go with the one that fits best.)",
        "text_sha256": "3cc84ebf1d5356457f87ebe7d4f328d792518a6a126591e2c034f8ec4d80b4a8",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The exact time of birth gives the clearest chart. If you don’t know it, choose “I don’t know” — the chart will still be meaningful, just without a rising sign or house placements.",
        "text_sha256": "4ce4bb062289d65c5ae7362483ad2234457d085f882e88690be30be352aa8309",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Fun fact: The Moon changes signs about every 2.5 days, so if your lovebug was born on a cusp (when one sign’s ending and another’s beginning), that timing can shift things a bit. If you’re not sure, we’ll help guide you through it.",
        "text_sha256": "db6a51376c6b5ed146a566774e1554c5e3197970606c9b31933ddba68fbee8ae",
        "word_count": 43
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Whether you’re a seasoned astrology lover or just feeling starry-eyed, your child’s birth chart is a tender, timeless way to explore what makes your baby so uniquely her. It’s less about prediction and more about connection.",
        "text_sha256": "eeb5594418307eadbe99e3f43a0850bae6a1124fce98acc1a94e81d237ca6b76",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Go ahead — take a peek at the sky the moment your tiny miracle arrived. The universe had a front-row seat.",
        "text_sha256": "835e5e6964e7c8dfc45806a3374036f2f30d46e04846398736a9503b5eb10647",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This birth chart was created just for you with help from AI. Remember, it's just for fun.",
        "text_sha256": "92b124a7038684acbc0560dc5d374bff962b5e7388cbd608151feeb6fa8253a5",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "FAQs About Birth Chart Calculator",
        "text_sha256": "1e0cf3f072e3110e5d14933f3f7f3f69ffe6befb2c95852dce0906cd980c2d7b",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "How to read your baby’s birth chart",
        "text_sha256": "8f73f9dcb823853bac2a75c44357d9be6cdb2e796115d01658c33a6f124a60d9",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Astrological birth charts can be tricky to read, but our birth chart provides a full description of your baby’s astrological traits, even if you don’t have much experience with astrology or birth charts. Just plug in your baby’s data points and let our tool do the hard work!",
        "text_sha256": "07ca3508f7663d29d70923fcc481d668fd535b0fc4a75a8a53dabdbe984e444a",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Can I use the birth chart calculator before my baby is born?",
        "text_sha256": "23c32de567013dca3cc5d091d709fecbd739ff65145776086762ad617d8d8932",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Yes, you can test out the birth chart calculator with your due date and anticipated location and time of birth. But until your baby is born, you won’t be able to know their unique chart. That’s something to look forward after you meet your little one!",
        "text_sha256": "3458ec7e0bc6aeeef6e30c6e11d85420b7d382fad45b5f61e8f5584e1968166b",
        "word_count": 46
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "How accurate is an astrological birth chart?",
        "text_sha256": "db242a2bc2bdf81bac3d31a34e52f559eefba3a55313f2a16f96eebf35bb278f",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Your baby could have a lot of the personality traits described in their birth chart…or not! Astrological birth charts are a lot of fun, but your baby will be a unique person with a personality all their own.",
        "text_sha256": "ef206a2608d19c8fe225f8162c99e65686b934e9779ba33685b3e110641e3962",
        "word_count": 38
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Go to Your Baby's Age",
        "text_sha256": "05a2c9b32af919d9a0a87b2762079ec33dc5246c16eaee9f0c85c8e3a83fe2ad",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Your Next Read",
        "text_sha256": "6d2b65f6bc74d3f3d5656d8c88c806ff70605a0ce9d4fd990efe9af093220755",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Curious What Your Baby Will Be Like? Start With Her Zodiac Sign Fact Checked by Catherine Donaldson-Evans, Managing Editor",
        "text_sha256": "8ac3ec664355d0364ccaf1b7119f1d6dbd4a4cd917097268044eaf34a6854cff",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Chinese Gender Predictor Chart Fact Checked by Christine Gordon",
        "text_sha256": "50cab9aab31a8359a4747b820ef26375f03708cf0ce2bcce4cd203f62edfc752",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "120 Astrological Baby Names Inspired by Your Baby's Zodiac Sign Fact Checked by Kathleen Felton, Contributing Writer/Editor",
        "text_sha256": "020cca0e8ef5e386c6e11e1d231361302712fb2896c86c2a56da99d2f02adcc5",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Traditional Baby Naming Ceremonies Are Getting a Modern Twist — Here's How to Plan Your Own Fact Checked by Caroline Picard, Deputy Editor",
        "text_sha256": "e30385402466c7d1d62184570a7e144e5818e420249901915715d5db45e7a7a7",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Why December Birthdays Are So Special: Festive Traditions and Standout Star Signs Fact Checked by Catherine Donaldson-Evans, Managing Editor",
        "text_sha256": "d113a8ed3c984df291c13bb98807767a5bb744a52888eb714aada0c82cc087a1",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Baby Clothes Sizes Chart and Guide Medically Reviewed by Kyle Monk, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "f128e293654b6f0911a82b2e54805a43a2a41d495e59adb153da6e448a1459fa",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You're Going to Need to Track Your Baby’s Feedings, Diaper Changes, Sleep, and More. Here's How Fact Checked by Caroline Picard, Deputy Editor",
        "text_sha256": "2e830b42e9a1ed2b40979c05c0b7df9253885c8d28388249a7a0b42b7e8bba6e",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Why June Birthdays Are Great: What to Know About Your Gemini or Cancer Baby Fact Checked by Catherine Donaldson-Evans, Managing Editor",
        "text_sha256": "1efc04dfceee719ec06490de9765ca082dd11688c76aa74a4ca263aaaccd1d49",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What to Write in a Baby Birth Announcement Fact Checked by Marygrace Taylor, Contributing Writer",
        "text_sha256": "2981f52e726c28893c21c5204e1993888d9bf39d70b1c5e6504a4cbab6b1eea3",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What Is Your Baby's Birth Flower? Fact Checked by Olivia DeLong, Senior Health Editor",
        "text_sha256": "a5e3539980a01ffad17017ef7acbbd4cc2fa60ad237f6ba03e21491c6cd6046b",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Is There Such a Thing as a Gifted Baby? Medically Reviewed by Gina Posner, M.D., F.A.A.P.",
        "text_sha256": "e30ec32988b5ebe929e3b2a2a19ab29fce9cf4857863662298200a4b43e78530",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Conception Date Calculator: When Did You Conceive? Medically Reviewed by Aaron Styer, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "edfc5b00844fbd64d6f2ae5027ff9acced8914639b1524a0c2dfb34dbed889a1",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Diaper Size Chart: Your Weight-Based Diapering Guide Medically Reviewed by Micah Resnick, M.D., F.A.A.P.",
        "text_sha256": "3a9877eb23b14a55c94967099b4e1177b6627a7cf07c759bc599b235dbc6d590",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
